'''Velka''' was a [[Ghorman (people)|Ghorman]] on the [[planet]] [[Ghorman|of the same name]]. Velka was present in a town hall meeting in [[Palmo]] where [[Ghorman Front]] members debated the spike in [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] interest in the planet.<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Velka first appeared in "[[Ever Been to Ghorman?]]," the fourth episode of the [[Andor Season 2|second season]] of the television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'' released on [[Disney+]]<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?" /> on [[April 29]], [[2025]].<ref name="Trailer News">{{SW|url=news/andor-season-2-teaser-trailer-key-art-reveal|text=First ''Andor A Star Wars Story'' Teaser Trailer and Poster Revealed}}</ref> While Velka is not clearly identified and their actor is uncredited for this role, Velka's name is mentioned in the subtitles when one of the Ghormans speak in the [[Ghor (language)|Ghor language]].<ref name="Ever Been to Ghorman?" />

